From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:14:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] GS6 patch B (part 1): AirSky::Chip on the air scene's sky
 (lids, small clouds' sight, drawn-out rags), its cloud test, M_CloudTurned's
 builder

The same Battle/AirSkyChip.inl as the ground's; Chip::Lay follows this AirSky's painter (SmallSight's haze, Long,
the deck's lids, FragmentLids). Tools/air_show/air_sky_chip_test.cpp passes against this painter: 1,000,428 points on
the ground's two skies and the three recordings, 0.010 m at most apart. Not yet wired into AirBattle.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
